WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:03.500
Though a woman, you possess ambitions that rival the soaring clouds.

00:04.680 --> 00:10.800
Your Highness jests. I harbor no soaring ambition; I simply refuse to be wed.

00:11.160 --> 00:16.000
Nor do I intend to leave the Chen household to curry favor in someone's inner courtyard.

00:17.120 --> 00:23.500
Therefore, representing only myself, I wish to forge a mutually beneficial alliance with Your Highness. What say you?
